│  changing).                                                        │
│  Please notice some behaviours given by the options **SHOULD** be  │
│  observed. For example,                                            │
│  files should be overwritten when the **force** option is ``True`  │
│  Similarly when                                                    │
│  **pretend** is ``True``, no operation should be really performed  │
│  but any action should                                             │
│  be logged as if realized.                                         │
│  """                                                               │
│  FileContents = Union[str, None]                                   │
│  """When the file content is ``None``, the file should not be      │
│  written to                                                        │
│  disk (empty files are represented by an empty string ``""`` as    │
│  content).                                                         │
│  """                                                               │
